[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PikouGame/Growing-Grounds/38fd04a96569df61264f218e354d24f5823255d6/assets/showcase/growing-grounds-hero-raised.png[/img][/center]

[size=6][color=#5cd5de][b]Give your base room to grow[/b][/color][/size]

[size=5]Gain [b]4% of your original base radius per level[/b], starting at level 2, up to [b]double the radius[/b] by default. Celebrate each expansion with a blue wave from the Palbox, a gentle bounce, and a rising glow.[/size]

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PikouGame/Growing-Grounds/999a446fffa9b154cb22e040a253101908e7cd89/assets/showcase/growing-grounds-upgrade-web.gif[/img][/center]

[size=5][i]Gameplay excerpt at original speed; initial wait trimmed.[/i][/size]

[size=6][color=#5cd5de][b]More room for your supplies[/b][/color][/size]

[size=5]Chests grow with your base: [b]20 bonus slots[/b] by default, arriving steadily from your first upgrade to the final base level. Guild Chests benefit too, with the bonus applied once to their shared inventory.[/size]

[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PikouGame/Growing-Grounds/3904f41043926d93065c73447a9a8adabfe72dbe/assets/showcase/growing-grounds-chest-slots.png[/img][/center]

[size=6][color=#5cd5de][b]Make it your own[/b][/color][/size]

[size=5]Adjust growth and both caps in [b]World Settings[/b], or in the server config:[/size]

[size=5]• [b]Range growth:[/b] 0–20% per level.[/size]
[size=5]• [b]Range bonus cap:[/b] up to +300%; +100% doubles the radius.[/size]
[size=5]• [b]Chest bonus cap:[/b] up to 40 extra slots.[/size]

[size=5]Set either cap to [b]0 (Off)[/b] to disable that bonus. Nearby bases can limit expansion. Lowering the chest cap keeps occupied extra slots until you empty them.[/size]

[size=6][color=#5cd5de][b]Getting started[/b][/color][/size]

[size=5]Install on the [b]host/server and clients[/b] with a compatible [b]Palworld UE4SS loader[/b]. Back up your world before installing, and keep your settings when updating.[/size]

[size=5][url=https://github.com/PikouGame/Growing-Grounds/blob/main/INSTALL.txt]Installation guide[/url] · [url=https://github.com/PikouGame/Growing-Grounds#testing-and-current-limits]Compatibility and known issues[/url][/size]

[size=6][color=#5cd5de][b]Share your experience[/b][/color][/size]

[size=5]We’d love to see what you build! Share your base, leave a comment, or [url=https://github.com/PikouGame/Growing-Grounds/issues]report a bug[/url] so we can keep improving Growing Grounds together.[/size]

[size=5][i]Made with OpenAI Codex and Claude under lelorax’s direction. Gameplay and UI captured in game; AI-assisted title lettering. Free to use; all rights reserved. Reuploads, published modifications and reuse require permission. Unofficial Palworld mod.[/i][/size]
